221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 146 0 R
/T (A simple distance threshold can make the network too dense because all stations are located within the same city. Using KNN with k = 2 preserves local neighbourhood relationships while still keeping the graph connected. This makes the network easier to interpret and allows meaningful comparison of degree distribution and community structure.)
/E (A simple distance threshold can make the network too dense because all stations are located within the same city. Using KNN with k = 2 preserves local neighbourhood relationships while still keeping the graph connected. This makes the network easier to interpret and allows meaningful comparison of degree distribution and community structure.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
