/Title (A simple distance threshold can make the network too dense because all stations are located within the same city. Using KNN with k = 2 preserves local neighbourhood relationships while still keeping the graph connected. This makes the network easier to interpret and allows meaningful comparison of degree distribution and community structure.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 877 0 R
/Next 889 0 R
>>
endobj
